on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [  3] pushint8 9 .............................. <9>
  [  6] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <7, 9>
  [  8] extcall 13 .............................. visible_off(7, 9)
  [ 10] pushint8 12 ............................. <12>
  [ 13] pushcons 0 .............................. <"03">
  [ 15] pushcons 8 .............................. <"Graphics">
  [ 17] pusharglist 2 ........................... <"03", "Graphics">
  [ 19] extcall 70 .............................. <member("03", "Graphics")>
  [ 22] getobjprop 71 ........................... <member("03", "Graphics").memberNum>
  [ 25] pushint8 35 ............................. <35>
  [ 28] set 6 ................................... set the memberNum of sprite 12 to member("03", "Graphics").memberNum
  [ 30] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 32] extcall 2 ............................... updateStage()
  [ 34] ret
end
